Two findings emerge from statistical testing.

\textbf{Statistical result:} With 10 pairwise McNemar tests ($\alpha = 0.05$, Bonferroni corrected to $\alpha' = 0.005$), GB significantly outperforms both LLMs (all $p < 0.001$) and LR ($p < 0.001$), while GB and RF show no significant difference ($\chi^2$ = 2.88, $p = 0.045 > 0.005$): DeepSeek-V3
